<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 6.8 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 6.8 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 6.8 percent in the week to December 24 over the equivalent week a year ago, figures from the Bank of England showed.</p>
<p>(figures in rounded billions of stg) -</p>
<p>			   Latest week  Previous week  Year-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation  23.19	  22.41	     21.72</p>
<p> Bankers deposits	2.07	   2.02		2.13</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
